#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:8
msgid "Support: stands guard there and fights its battles until called home."
msgstr "Podrška: tamo drži stražu i vodi bitke dok ga ne pozovu kući."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:9
msgid "Reinforce: joins the battle there, then comes home."
msgstr "Pojačanje: pridružuje se bici tamo, pa se vraća kući."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:10
msgid "Harass (mostly cavalry): strikes one round hard, takes few losses, rides home."
msgstr "Uznemiravanje (uglavnom konjica): snažno udari u jednom krugu, pretrpi malo gubitaka i jaše kući."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:11
msgid "Hold: digs in on a hex and fights every horde whose road runs through it."
msgstr "Držanje: ukopava se na polju i bori se sa svakom hordom koja prolazi tuda."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:12
msgid "Clear: storms a camp or lair and holds its hex with the loot until moved or called home."
msgstr "Očisti: juriša na logor ili jazbinu i drži to polje s plenom dok je ne pomeriš ili pozoveš kući."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:13
msgid "Explore: fights any guardians, searches the site for some hours, then holds its hex with what it found. Scouts may go too."
msgstr "Istraži: bori se sa čuvarima, pretražuje mesto nekoliko sati, pa drži to polje s onim što je našla. I izviđači mogu da idu."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:14
msgid "Garrison: marches into your village and joins its garrison, bringing what grain it has left."
msgstr "Posada: ulazi u tvoje selo i pridružuje se njegovoj posadi, donoseći žito koje joj je ostalo."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:21
msgid "Come home when done: they guard the shipyard against its raiders until the boat is finished, then march home with what they carry."
msgstr "Vrati se kad završi: čuvaju brodogradilište od pljačkaša dok čamac ne bude gotov, pa se vraćaju kući s onim što nose."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:23
msgid "Come home when done: they march to the village, fight its battle if one is on, then come home instead of standing guard."
msgstr "Vrati se kad završi: odlaze do sela, biju njegovu bitku ako je u toku, pa se vraćaju kući umesto da ostanu na straži."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:24
msgid "Come home when done: they march to the hex and straight back, instead of holding it."
msgstr "Vrati se kad završi: odlaze do polja i odmah nazad, umesto da ga drže."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:25
msgid "Come home when done: once the camp is cleared they bring its loot home instead of holding its hex."
msgstr "Vrati se kad završi: kad očiste logor, nose plen kući umesto da drže njegovo polje."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:26
msgid "Come home when done: once the guardians are beaten and the site searched, they bring what they found home."
msgstr "Vrati se kad završi: kad pobede čuvare i pretraže nalazište, nose kući ono što su našli."

#: client/scripts/game/army_text.gd:27
msgid "Come home when done: once their errand is done they march home by themselves."
msgstr "Vrati se kad završi: kad obave zadatak, sami se vraćaju kući."

