#: client/scripts/screens/start_screen.gd:829
msgid "Slavian keeps as little as it can: the name you choose (or a guest name), your sign-in sessions, and the state of the worlds you play in. There is no advertising, no tracking and no sharing with third parties. Push notifications use your device token only to reach you. You can download what is kept about you and delete your account at any time from this screen. Deletion removes the account, its sessions, memberships and device tokens."
msgstr "Slavian čuva što je manje moguće: ime koje izabereš (ili gostujuće ime), tvoje prijavne sesije i stanje svetova u kojima igraš. Nema oglašavanja, praćenja ni deljenja sa trećim stranama. Push obaveštenja koriste token tvog uređaja samo da bi te dosegla. Ono što se čuva o tebi možeš preuzeti i obrisati nalog u svakom trenutku sa ovog ekrana. Brisanje uklanja nalog, njegove sesije, članstva i tokene uređaja."

