#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:11
msgid "Hordes come from the edges of the world, wave after wave, for the Holy City at its heart. Raise villages around it, hold them, and build the Kalinov Bridge before the city falls."
msgstr "Sa ivica sveta, talas za talasom, dolaze horde po Sveti grad u njegovom srcu. Podigni sela oko njega, odbrani ih i sagradi Kalinov most pre nego što grad padne."

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:12
msgid "First steps"
msgstr "Prvi koraci"

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:12
msgid "The card at the top of the map shows the next step and why it matters, with a reward for each. Stuck? The ? button explains; once the steps are done it opens the almanac."
msgstr "Kartica na vrhu mape pokazuje sledeći korak i zašto je važan, uz nagradu za svaki. Zapeo si? Dugme ? objašnjava; kad se koraci završe, otvara almanah."

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:13
msgid "A hero from the old tales leads your armies. It gains levels and skills, wears gear that beaten hordes leave behind, and goes on quests for more."
msgstr "Junak iz starih priča predvodi tvoje vojske. Napreduje u nivoima i veštinama, nosi opremu koju pobeđene horde ostave i ide u zadatke po još."

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:14
msgid "Your village"
msgstr "Tvoje selo"

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:14
msgid "Fields bring wood, stone, grain and iron, and each village keeps its own stores. The Elder's Hall opens more plots; barracks train troops; walls and towers keep the hordes out."
msgstr "Polja donose drvo, kamen, žito i gvožđe, a svako selo čuva svoje zalihe. Starešinska kuća otvara nova mesta za gradnju; kasarna obučava trupe; zidine i kule drže horde napolju."

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:15
msgid "The map"
msgstr "Mapa"

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:15
msgid "Around your villages lie rich hexes for outposts, roads that speed marches, camps to clear and old sites to explore. Hold a hex on a horde's road, and an ambush or a fort can stop it there."
msgstr "Oko tvojih sela su bogata polja za ispostave, putevi koji ubrzavaju pokrete, logori za čišćenje i stara mesta za istraživanje. Drži polje na putu horde, i zaseda ili utvrda mogu da je zaustave tu."

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:16
msgid "The hordes"
msgstr "Horde"

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:16
msgid "Each wave is told before it sets out, and its road is drawn in red. Scouts count it. Meet it on the road, behind your walls, or send help to whoever it comes for."
msgstr "Svaki talas se najavi pre nego što krene, a njegov put je ucrtan crvenom. Izviđači ga prebroje. Dočekaj ga na putu, iza zidina, ili pošalji pomoć onome po koga dolazi."

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:17
msgid "Battle"
msgstr "Bitka"

#: client/scripts/ui/picture_book.gd:17
msgid "Battles go round by round. Numbers, stance, walls, the ground and help from neighbours decide them. Win, and the horde is gone; lose, and it raids or burns the village."
msgstr "Bitke idu rundu po rundu. Odlučuju brojnost, stav, zidine, teren i pomoć suseda. Pobedi, i horde više nema; izgubi, i ona pljačka ili spaljuje selo."

